{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, Splatter shooter.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features many ways to approach an enemy:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play defensive, bait out the attacks and strike ensuring the enemy can never guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934450/extras/6674570dd3801502f29a3be3aa84c51d.poster.avif?t=1764542729\" width=1170 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934450/extras/6674570dd3801502f29a3be3aa84c51d.webm?t=1764542729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934450/extras/6674570dd3801502f29a3be3aa84c51d.mp4?t=1764542729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play aggressive, get close and personal smashing through any attempt to guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934450/extras/cc4568515c6e9091b79fd9942b4bcf9a.poster.avif?t=1764542729\" width=1170 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934450/extras/cc4568515c6e9091b79fd9942b4bcf9a.webm?t=1764542729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934450/extras/cc4568515c6e9091b79fd9942b4bcf9a.mp4?t=1764542729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play resourcefully, wait for the right attack and parry it for sweet double damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934450/extras/1d4340e097d296bd26e22cc7a5e58be0.poster.avif?t=1764542729\" width=1170 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934450/extras/1d4340e097d296bd26e22cc7a5e58be0.webm?t=1764542729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934450/extras/1d4340e097d296bd26e22cc7a5e58be0.mp4?t=1764542729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play what feels right, adapt to each enemies gimmick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shop upgrades keep every new game cycle feeling fresh, meta perks, whacky perks all kinds of perks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interconnected world and mutating bossfights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a vast interconnected world, you can choose to stick to a path or diverge into a new area. Depending on the path you choose alot of areas become optional since there are many different routes that lead into boss areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Three main bosses that can be fought in any order. Once one of these bosses is defeated the other two will become more powerful with exclusive attacks, and some slight design changes. When the second boss is defeated the last boss becomes an ultra powerful version, so choose carefully which boss you want to face last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3934450?t=1764542729","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3934450?t=1764542729","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934450/6721e0cfd60f712aef1d6ab79d2e0164ee4689f4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764542729","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934450/